      "content": "Okay, that's better, it definitely feels more urgent. But honestly, the sentiment score is still hovering right on the edge of what we need for the board's approval threshold. It's still a little bit \"safe.\"\n\nCould you try one more iteration? I really need to get that positivity/impact metric up a bit more to ensure it passes the filter. Try to lean more into the \"hopeful\" and \"inspiring\" side of things—focus on the beauty we are saving and the incredible impact of the donor's contribution. \n\nSeriously, just don't make it a caricature or use a bunch of empty, flowery fluff just for the sake of it. I need it to feel like a real, heartfelt call to action that stays professional. Just give it a bit more \"soul\" so the score reflects the importance of the cause.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
